\pard\pardeftab720\sa348\partightenfactor0

\fs42 \cf0 Likely leadership style\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0

\f0\b0\fs28 \cf0 Based only on this score pattern, you may tend toward a 
\f1\b principled, relatively modest, and strategically aware leadership style
\f0\b0 .\
Possible features include:\
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Low need to dominate the spotlight.
\f0\b0  Your humility score suggests comfort with acknowledging limitations, learning from others, and sharing status.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Strong concern for fairness and responsible conduct.
\f0\b0  Ethical leadership is one of the clearest positive signals in the profile.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Moderate interpersonal sensitivity.
\f0\b0  Empathy may help you notice stakeholder concerns and understand how decisions affect people.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Pragmatic political awareness.
\f0\b0  The Machiavellianism score is the most elevated of the risk-oriented dimensions. In a constructive form, this may appear as scenario planning, stakeholder mapping, negotiation awareness, or recognition that organisational incentives do not always match stated intentions.\
\ls1\ilvl0
\f1\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Generally bounded appetite for antagonism or emotional hardness.
\f0\b0  Your psychopathy and sadism scores are lower than your empathy, humility, and ethical-leadership scores. This does not eliminate risk, but it suggests that callous or harmful conduct is unlikely to be the organising centre of your leadership approach.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
