\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Spending disproportionate effort anticipating political reactions\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa280\partightenfactor0
\cf0 The productive side is vigilance. The risk is that vigilance becomes suspicion.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa327\partightenfactor0

